    "body": "I pretty much had to use a similar workaround where the click/focus on a content editable element would trigger the input element's picker:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif (Browser.IS_SAFARI) {\r\n  inputElement.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click'));\r\n} else {\r\n  inputElement.showPicker();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nFull code - [Link](https://github.com/OvidijusParsiunas/active-table/blob/592afdcc4bd715edcf59e589ec7c076400140869/component/src/elements/cell/cellsWithTextDiv/dateCell/dateCellCalendarIconEvents.ts#L35)\r\nLive project - [Link](https://activetable.io/)",
